{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive, Grow Strong, Get Rematched!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Afterschool: Reel Danger is a partially narrative, continuously playable 2D roguelite action game. In this adventure that begins after school, choose one of three playable characters and try to survive endless waves of enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use the coins you earn from defeating enemies to purchase new abilities and upgrades from the Merchant and Enchanter. Overcome challenges with more powerful attacks, greater range, new special abilities, </strong>and characters that change your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Be careful about the movies you watch, otherwise strange things may happen to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find your classmates and face the truth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/99dc8b004b0aabcf19d63f89bcd5358d.webp?t=1765568637\" width=50 height=107 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/27c53f78a10a0cbd5470f468e865d5f6.webp?t=1765568637\" width=50 height=109 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/c75f427ff29017711a6f6a51afac59f3.webp?t=1765568637\" width=50 height=122 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/c29fa0f6aef38276373901b9cd243b26.webp?t=1765568637\" width=50 height=117 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/0c508f1ea80672ebf582ca59f2c39928.webp?t=1765568637\" width=50 height=123 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/906a09f4790c6487457e7422aeea3ea9.webp?t=1765568637\" width=60 height=120 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/0dc5d4eaa3f1b052c6fc282ad35e6faf.webp?t=1765568637\" width=60 height=117 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/78d10375b41522a3a10e62974edf4669.webp?t=1765568637\" width=45 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf 3 different playable characters \u2013 Each with their own unique abilities and playstyle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0 Skill Development System \u2013 Strengthen and shape your abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfeb Hub Area: School \u2013 Story progression, permanent upgrades, and a rest stop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 2 Elite Enemies &amp; 1 Giant Boss \u2013 Challenging and strategic battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u267e Endless Waves of Enemies \u2013 Challenge your reflexes to face threats from all directions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Retro Pixel Graphics &amp; Atmospheric Soundtrack \u2013 A blend of nostalgia and modern action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Interactive Crystals - 8 different crystals. These crystals spawn randomly and provide different effects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcda Quest system - 3 different styles of quests.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/71c297126ab0653f1d5b59ff8ebbb1d0.webp?t=1765568637\" width=26 height=19 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/c4dfbe7c76caf3a462e896442c2ffc4f.webp?t=1765568637\" width=23 height=19 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/dabfb6e87448ae7681a7f65d24c6b2b7.webp?t=1765568637\" width=33 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/eef42c2eef390949002c7d5a439ae05d.webp?t=1765568637\" width=72 height=22 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/ff6ed6a2ee1debe0d7b74e8cdc251a3a.webp?t=1765568637\" width=35 height=52 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/325585d2e8e039fd58e428d3a0c53138.webp?t=1765568637\" width=41 height=42 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953220/extras/d9d15f8cd91bac1dcab73d1b3096eb53.webp?t=1765568637\" width=56 height=30 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared